          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Related categories</span></span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment.html\">Medical and surgical equipment</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/bedframes.html\">Bed frames</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/content/stryker/us/en/portfolios/medical-surgical-equipment/bedframes/icu-critical-care-beds.html\">ICU critical care beds</a></p>\n",
