          "text": "<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Siderails</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Designed with an intermediate support position that allows patients to help themselves enter or exit the bed—helping reduce the risk of falls and the risk of injury to the caregiver.</span></p>\n",
