          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">iBed Awareness</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Monitors local bed status information and alerts caregivers visually, audibly or remotely if preset parameters are compromised.</span></p>\n",
