          "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "kent.schwartz@stryker.com",
          "jcr:created": "Tue Oct 02 2018 16:06:05 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Open Architecture</span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Our open&nbsp;architecture platform gives you clinical and financial flexibility to choose any support surface for the bed. It also accommodates most traction systems on the market, eliminating the expense of additional brackets or frames.</span></p>\n",
