          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h2><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">StayPut Bed Frame Technology</span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">The movement of the Stryker-exclusive StayPut Bed Frame maintains the relative location of the patient when the head of the bed is raised. This helps reduce the need for patient repositioning once the bed adjustment is made.</span></p>\n",
          "jcr:lastModified": "Wed Feb 21 2024 15:52:44 GMT+0000",
          "sling:resourceType": "stryker/components/content/text",
