          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Advanced Fall Prevention<sup>1*</sup></span></span></span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Caregivers can take a more proactive approach to help prevent patient falls with an enhanced ability to monitor risk and the tools necessary to respond in a timely manner.</span></p>\n",
