    "disclaimer-type": "text",
    "disclaimer": "<p>1. The features listed are only available when iBed Wireless is integrated with third party systems that bring data to EHRs, Handheld devices, Alert Management Systems, Nurse Call, or Asset Management Systems. The iBed Wireless System requires iBed Radios, iBed Locators, and a Stryker Server application.</p>\r\n<p>2. Facility must meet eligibility requirements as outlined in the iBed Wireless Fall Reduction Contract. iBed Wireless System includes iBed Radios, iBed Locators, and a Stryker server application.</p>\r\n<p>*When combining the proper processes and technologies to help reduce risk of bed related falls.</p>\r\n",
